[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=21 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="回来的箱子堆在防水布上，大小差不多，表面的编号却有的朝上有的朝里。你想让人先按编号摆齐，拉姆森说先别动，看看哪只底下在滴水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="它们不是都湿了吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="外面湿，里面未必进。你按编号排完，它在哪个位置进过水就说不清了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们从最先卸下的开始，逐只记录。第三只的标签上写着净水膜，重量却和旁边装旧电池的差不多。德雷顿扶住秤，等指针完全停下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不能怪海水。它要真喝了这么多，里面现在得是锅汤。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="封口没有我们打的记号。不是回来路上换的，是放到残骸里以前就错了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们要把这只箱子当诱饵？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先当“标签和实物不符”。诱饵是下一步需要证明的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把自己刚写的词划掉，没有把纸撕掉。里面只有一组被磨掉铭牌的接口、一袋坏掉的保险片，还有一只装着小纸条的玻璃管。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="纸条上说“不要接主回路”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="这条倒是好话。接口上还有盐，谁现在接谁就准备听我骂到明天。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="玻璃管是用食品罐改的，边上残着一点甜味。你想到一个人可能是吃完最后一口糖才想起没地方放纸条，便没再觉得这份线索一定得长得庄重。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="如果是放箱子的人想提醒后来的人，为什么不把字写在外面？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="也许他不想让收走箱子的人先看见。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="也可能外面原来有，后来掉了。都记下，我们还没资格替他写动机。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把玻璃管重新塞回软布里。拉姆森在那只箱子上贴了一张很大的隔离标记，告诉仓库管理员先别拆包。管理员问里面值多少钱，她说现在能少炸一次，就已经比标价值钱。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我是不是问了太多没用的问题？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="你刚才至少没把它插上。继续问，问完再动手。海里已经有够多的人把这个顺序反过来了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

